- Generated Markdown GitHub GFM API render: thirteen independent lists with lengths 2,5,4,5,4,6,6,3,4,8,6,9,4. All ten fixed separator comments occur between adjacent independent lists. The nine S06 cases remain separate items. The API does not attach automatic heading IDs, so its explicit properties alias plus unchanged h2 is evidence of collision risk, not a claimed observed duplicate DOM ID.
- Twelve local cases (Chromium/Firefox/WebKit, 375/1280 px, /NEPL3/ and /review/nested/, JavaScript disabled): HTTP 200, no failed requests, supplied stylesheet applied, 772 Ruby instances, no horizontal document overflow, all six stable section IDs unique with correct navigation, chapter 17 relative link and reload successful.
