Resolved HTML output is byte-identical to the initially reviewed HTML for all fourteen files, including manifest and CSS. The two resolved generations are likewise byte-identical for all fourteen files. The annotated Markdown body is unchanged apart from metadata and the redundant alias removal; all ten separator boundaries remain. Adopted Markdown matches the resolved generation exactly.

